WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.891 --> 00:00:03.344
(gunshot)
- Oh!

00:00:03.344 --> 00:00:06.601
(slow James Bond themed music)

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.043
- I don't like guns at all.

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:12.807
- I don't have a negative
opinion about guns,

00:00:12.807 --> 00:00:14.653
I do have negative opinions about people.

00:00:14.653 --> 00:00:16.487
- I've been invited to a gun
range before with friends,

00:00:16.487 --> 00:00:17.985
and I've said no, and I've just

00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:19.564
sat in the car outside of the gun range

00:00:19.564 --> 00:00:20.703
while they shot guns.

00:00:20.703 --> 00:00:22.523
- I'm an Eagle Scout, I
was raised in the South,

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:24.209
I've shot a lot of guns.

00:00:24.209 --> 00:00:25.844
.22 rifle, 10-gauge shotgun,

00:00:25.844 --> 00:00:27.447
12-gauge shotgun, Desert Eagle,

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:29.884
and another type of handgun
that I don't remember.

00:00:29.884 --> 00:00:31.618
- Who are you?
- It was my bachelor party.

00:00:31.618 --> 00:00:33.059
- What?

00:00:33.059 --> 00:00:34.686
- I shot an arrow once.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:39.161
- I question why as a society
we consider guns masculine.

00:00:39.161 --> 00:00:40.543
- It's like a James Bond thing,

00:00:40.543 --> 00:00:43.418
and he's a cool, sexy guy,
and I'm a cool, sexy guy.

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:45.081
- They keep talking about James Bond.

00:00:45.081 --> 00:00:46.800
Kieth will not shut up about Texas?

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.574
- When we dress like James
Bond, it's not real somehow.

00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:50.933
- These are military grade weapons,

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:52.837
whose only purpose is to kill people.

00:00:52.837 --> 00:00:55.553
To kill a lot of people
very fast, very effectively.

00:00:55.553 --> 00:00:56.900
- When you grow up around guns,

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.432
you know how to handle them properly.

00:00:58.432 --> 00:01:00.023
We should be able to go to a gun range

00:01:00.023 --> 00:01:02.181
and fire military-grade weapons.

00:01:02.181 --> 00:01:03.643
- I'm going to go into this fresh,

00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:05.979
thinking, what is the feeling
that I'm going to get from it?

00:01:05.979 --> 00:01:08.997
Because maybe there is something
to masculinity and guns.

00:01:08.997 --> 00:01:11.679
- If I get to wear a tuxedo
and shoot guns, I'm excited.

00:01:11.679 --> 00:01:16.232
(fast typing)

00:01:16.232 --> 00:01:18.481
- You could die here.

00:01:18.481 --> 00:01:19.551
- What?

00:01:19.551 --> 00:01:20.655
- I'll hook it up in here for you.

00:01:20.655 --> 00:01:21.550
Only thing that you've
- Woah!

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:22.445
- got to do is cock it down.

00:01:22.445 --> 00:01:23.342
- [Try Guy] Okay.

00:01:23.342 --> 00:01:24.726
- [Instructor] Then close it.

00:01:25.803 --> 00:01:26.976
- And I'm ready, this is live.

00:01:26.976 --> 00:01:28.149
- [Instructor] That's a live round.

00:01:28.149 --> 00:01:29.323
- Guy's I'm going to sh--
(gunshot)

00:01:29.323 --> 00:01:30.780
Oh!

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:31.892
- The first blow went off and I jumped.

00:01:31.892 --> 00:01:32.851
I was not ready for it.

00:01:32.851 --> 00:01:34.215
There was no "ready, set, go."

00:01:34.215 --> 00:01:35.501
- Alright, here goes nothing.

00:01:38.224 --> 00:01:38.885
(gunshot)

00:01:38.885 --> 00:01:40.818
- Oh, Jesus Christ!

00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:43.894
- Assault rifles are actually
easier to shoot than handguns.

00:01:43.894 --> 00:01:46.612
There's hardly any kick
because it goes so fast.

00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:47.628
- Woo!
(gunshot)

00:01:47.628 --> 00:01:49.003
- It's easy to forget why you're there,

00:01:49.003 --> 00:01:51.430
that the purpose of these
guns is to kill people,

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:52.916
and each time you're pulling the trigger,

00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:55.713
that's another life you could be taking.

00:01:55.713 --> 00:01:58.196
- I'm Keith! How you doing?

00:01:58.196 --> 00:02:00.194
- It gives you this real adrenaline

00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:02.597
that took me hours to come down from.

00:02:02.597 --> 00:02:04.316
- I think my body went on a high--

00:02:04.316 --> 00:02:05.036
- [Voiceover] Yeah.

00:02:05.036 --> 00:02:06.614
- [Voiceover] and I just
completely turned into this

00:02:06.614 --> 00:02:10.191
very primitive, basic creature.

00:02:10.191 --> 00:02:12.291
- [Voiceover] When you just
repeat shoot like that,

00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:14.357
you're almost afraid of yourself.

00:02:14.357 --> 00:02:16.115
- [Voiceover] Me taking the safety off,

00:02:16.115 --> 00:02:17.351
could've killed someone.
- Oh!

00:02:17.351 --> 00:02:18.366
- Can I just get a hug?

00:02:18.366 --> 00:02:19.757
Can I just get a hug real quick?

00:02:19.757 --> 00:02:22.448
(fast typing)

00:02:22.448 --> 00:02:24.320
- Does my cheekbone really have
to be that close to the gun?

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:25.078
- No, not too close.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:25.823
- And it's not going to hurt my cheek?

00:02:26.152 --> 00:02:27.315
- No, Lean your body forward.

00:02:27.315 --> 00:02:28.530
- Okay.
- Okay.

00:02:29.714 --> 00:02:31.750
(gunshot)
- Oh, mother of God!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.268
This (beep) became like an adult toy.

00:02:34.268 --> 00:02:35.685
Guns are not toys.

00:02:35.685 --> 00:02:38.843
- Oh, every time it's
punching me in the arm.

00:02:38.843 --> 00:02:41.420
Now that I've done it, I
get it, it's exhilarating.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.599
- Oh, I feel that power!

00:02:45.599 --> 00:02:47.607
It's like I'm turning into an animal.

00:02:47.607 --> 00:02:49.384
I'm going to try and shoot
this guy in the nuts.

00:02:49.384 --> 00:02:51.404
Who does that?

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:52.902
- Woo!

00:02:52.902 --> 00:02:55.026
- I killed him!

00:02:55.026 --> 00:02:56.222
How many times am I shooting this?

00:02:56.222 --> 00:02:57.986
All I could think of
while I was shooting is,

00:02:57.986 --> 00:02:59.902
"Aw man, I hope I'm out of bullets."

00:03:01.886 --> 00:03:03.731
(fast typing)

00:03:03.731 --> 00:03:06.584
- Probably the biggest
- Damn

00:03:06.584 --> 00:03:08.453
revolver that's commercially made.

00:03:08.453 --> 00:03:10.815
- Whoever gets the closest to the red dot

00:03:10.815 --> 00:03:12.372
will not have to pay for dinner.

00:03:12.372 --> 00:03:13.915
- It's like playing a
round of golf with weapons.

00:03:13.915 --> 00:03:14.750
- Exactly.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.910
- If you feel the recoil
is too much for you,

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.071
let it go over your head.

00:03:18.071 --> 00:03:19.696
Do not fight it, because
it will come back.

00:03:19.696 --> 00:03:21.229
- So you can punch yourself in the face?

00:03:21.229 --> 00:03:22.656
- Yeah, don't do that.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.307
- Wow, it is heavy.

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:28.780
- Who do you think will be the
worst, from what you've seen?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.070
(laughing)

00:03:34.224 --> 00:03:37.997
(gunshot)
- Oh, holy (beep).

00:03:37.997 --> 00:03:40.668
(gunshot)
- Ahhhhh!

00:03:43.451 --> 00:03:45.888
(gunshot)
- Ah!

00:03:47.042 --> 00:03:49.271
(gunshot)
(Jeers)

00:03:49.271 --> 00:03:51.500
- Ah, that was terrifying!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.729
- [Voiceover] Keith wins.

00:03:53.729 --> 00:03:54.901
- I'm really glad I did it.

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:57.166
I've not done it so many
times because I was afraid,

00:03:57.166 --> 00:04:00.381
but I faced my fear, and
I think it's totally fine

00:04:00.381 --> 00:04:02.947
to shoot any kind of gun in a gun range,

00:04:02.947 --> 00:04:04.491
because that's the place you go.

00:04:04.491 --> 00:04:05.810
You play golf on a golf course,

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.201
you shoot guns in a gun range.

00:04:07.201 --> 00:04:08.655
- The first thing I said
when I held the gun was,

00:04:08.655 --> 00:04:10.976
was I turned and then I
said, "Take a photo of me."

00:04:10.976 --> 00:04:13.171
And all I can think of is I'm desperately

00:04:13.171 --> 00:04:14.796
trying to compensate for something.

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:16.666
- I get it, I now get it.

00:04:16.666 --> 00:04:18.390
I didn't get it, and now I get it.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.553
Guns are really (beep) fun.

00:04:20.553 --> 00:04:22.155
- It changed me.

00:04:22.155 --> 00:04:26.591
I don't think that I'm as
pro-gun as I used to be.

00:04:26.591 --> 00:04:28.406
- In terms of actually feeling more manly

00:04:28.406 --> 00:04:30.375
from shooting a gun...

00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:32.116
I don't think I'm more of a man.

00:04:32.116 --> 00:04:33.835
- The experience didn't turn us into men,

00:04:33.835 --> 00:04:35.089
it turned us into boys.

00:04:35.089 --> 00:04:36.158
- I might have kids one day.

00:04:36.158 --> 00:04:39.690
There's no way that my kids
are responsible gun owners.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.962
An accident is bound to happen.

00:04:41.962 --> 00:04:44.376
- The men, or the people at the gun range,

00:04:44.376 --> 00:04:45.892
who really knew what they were doing,

00:04:45.892 --> 00:04:48.022
I respect that.

00:04:48.022 --> 00:04:49.530
- I guess my takeaway today
is that the whole thing

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:50.878
is a little more complicated.

00:04:50.878 --> 00:04:52.597
I see why people like it.

00:04:52.597 --> 00:04:57.158
It doesn't necessarily
change the way I think,

00:04:57.158 --> 00:04:59.921
but it does shade it in a little bit.

00:04:59.921 --> 00:05:01.992
- For the record, for me personally,

00:05:01.992 --> 00:05:04.519
eating pizza is still
more of a genuine thrill

00:05:04.519 --> 00:05:06.539
than shooting a gun.

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:08.502
- Yeah, this is pretty good.

00:05:08.502 --> 00:05:10.349
And, it's quite a kick.

00:05:10.349 --> 00:05:12.424
(laughter)

